    "title": "Several police agencies respond to incident in Terre Haute - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dana Winklepleck ,\n1 hours ago TERRE HAUTE, Ind. (WTWO/WAWV) -- Multiple police agencies are on the scene of an incident at N. 4th Street and Florida Avenue on the north end of Terre Haute.\nOur crew on the scene says Indiana State Police, the Terre Haute Police Department, and Vigo County Sheriff's department are all there.\nWe will keep you posted as more information becomes available.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed.\nFor the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to MyWabashValley.com.",
